{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>One crushed.</b> Testicles without the organ [variant: missing]. The grammarians say the meaning is their flesh, which is crushed. This is far-fetched." "<b>Flows.</b> This is the organ from which his waters and seed flow." "<b>In the congregation of YHWH.</b> The meaning is that he is not counted as one of the congregation of YHWH to take a daughter of Israel. Likewise: Ammonite and not Ammonitess, Moabite and not Moabitess. And the trustworthy witness is Ruth. And the verse that says 'you shall not come into them' concerns the women of the seven nations. Also the verse in Ezra: 'they separated every foreign wife' — they are the ones (mentioned), and there I explained it."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {0 "The bracketed variant חסר ('missing') is given for the text read by the grammarians; ס״א is the standard abbreviation for 'another version.'"}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:24:29.141100218Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}